@startuml AgentPay Purchase Sequence
!theme plain
title Lean V1 purchase with buyer maximum and x402 v2

actor Buyer
participant "Go API" as API
participant "Evidence" as Evidence
participant "x402 facilitator" as Facilitator
participant "Seller API" as Seller

Buyer -> API : POST /v1/intents
API -> API : Resolve route, freeze quote,\nvalidate quote <= maximumAmount
API --> Buyer : 201 immutable intent (status=ready)
Buyer -> API : paid-route request + intent
API -> API : validate intent, request, seller,\nroute, destination, and entitlement
API --> Buyer : 402 + PAYMENT-REQUIRED
Buyer -> Buyer : Authorize exact wallet payment
Buyer -> API : retry + PAYMENT-SIGNATURE
API -> Facilitator : verify and settle exact testnet payment
Facilitator --> API : settlement response
API -> Evidence : append payment.verified
API -> API : require finality + conditional forwarding claim
API -> Seller : ES256-authorized allowlisted request
Seller --> API : response
API -> Evidence : append delivery.succeeded/failed
API --> Buyer : seller response + transaction ID + PAYMENT-RESPONSE
@enduml
